<title>INDIA: India's RBI says 364-day t-bill cut-off unchanged.</title>
<headline>India's RBI says 364-day t-bill cut-off unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Wednesday it set a cut-off price of 88.80 rupees at the fortnightly auction of 364-day treasury bills, unchanged from the last auction.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield worked out to 12.65 percent.</p>
<p>The RBI said it received 18 bids for 2.69 billion rupees of which it accepted nine for 2.25 billion.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
